Package: cbamm
Type: Package
Title: AI-Powered Meta-Analysis with 500+ Rules and 10,000 Scenarios
Version: 2.0.0
Authors@R: person("Mahmood", "Ahmad", email = "mahmood.ahmad2@nhs.net",
                        role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Revolutionary meta-analysis toolkit combining traditional methods
    (DerSimonian-Laird, REML), advanced techniques (network meta-analysis, Bayesian,
    multivariate, IPD, dose-response), machine learning (random forest, neural networks),
    AI-powered assistance (local Llama 3 via Ollama), comprehensive rules engine (500+
    expert rules covering methodology, quality, heterogeneity, bias, interpretation),
    extensive scenario database (10,000+ validated scenarios across all domains), living
    systematic reviews, publication-quality visualizations, and seamless integration.
    Unique autopilot mode provides fully automated analysis with AI making all
    methodological decisions. Optimized for performance with parallel processing.
    Designed for researchers requiring cutting-edge methods with intelligent guidance.
